  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_074871abe64e42668b06e678a22cdc9b",
      "statement": "The ZoneMinder container uses a root vs app user separation for MariaDB: root (MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD) performs one-time bootstrap (CREATE DATABASE, CREATE USER, GRANT), while the app user (ZM_DB_USER/ZM_DB_PASS) handles schema import and runtime operations.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L18-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3501fd64377de1ff25e74c6235ba74f196a6c2f8d72f2e2096c7d70b12896262:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L5-L14",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e15d7d88d895c13caeab122b07604b33cd748f2f62c6868aa451375dc18df52d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L57-L64",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a35871e60d7e108e3afa9c74caca109b129486e963e207078484755adfae7998:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_69b82739cb924eb491c818a28dce8c46",
      "statement": "On first run (zero tables in ZM_DB_NAME), entrypoint.sh bootstraps the database by connecting as root to create the database and app user, then imports /usr/share/zoneminder/db/zm_create.sql as the app user.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L48-L64",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:22f94ba57a68117c2014d7588b5ef74dba406863e45f393322349cce72ad484c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a0f85de905a7497ca222bd6f9a941e8b",
      "statement": "The table-count check (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.tables WHERE table_schema = '$ZM_DB_NAME') determines whether to run bootstrap; if tables exist, bootstrap is skipped.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L48-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b0831202c7b19e229d33140d115056c0107ff000d2c3b82bd6ad9cfaf248c17d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f36ed25e961949df901f84911047aeaa",
      "statement": "ZM_OPT_USE_EVENTNOTIFICATION is forced to '1' on every container start via UPDATE Config SET Value = '1' WHERE Name = 'ZM_OPT_USE_EVENTNOTIFICATION', enabling the event notification pipeline.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L66-L68",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:015c6c5dcf4ad868bc281136879c3687cc6e7c271d71bfc43cc41d882a4bcbdd:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_797e1a01cd4e45e78d81e7375914c299",
      "statement": "The sed commands that rewrite ZM_DB_HOST, ZM_DB_USER, ZM_DB_PASS, and ZM_DB_NAME into /etc/zm/zm.conf are placed after `exec \"$@\"` in entrypoint.sh and therefore never execute; zm.conf keeps the values seeded from /org/etc/zm on first run.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L69-L78",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3d90be72166b1bff059f0ce5fa01c947704010df2141bd790b4c061af46be711:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bcc3efa46e9a458a98f7e83dd8d81da8",
      "statement": "docker-compose.yml wires the MariaDB service (named 'db') and ZoneMinder service with shared credentials: MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD, MYSQL_DATABASE, MYSQL_USER, MYSQL_PASSWORD are passed to both services, and ZM_DB_* variables in ZoneMinder reference the same values.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L4-L30",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f973433f52378ad17f4678aed144560ba859061cf7cc8522642a0db6e229acf8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_68e103fc9f154fefb38dbb4f4211dcb3",
      "statement": "The app-identity credentials are coupled across services: docker-compose.yml sets ZM_DB_PASS to the same ${MYSQL_PASSWORD} secret used by the db service's MYSQL_PASSWORD, and ZM_DB_USER to ${MYSQL_USER}, while ZM_DB_HOST is hard-coded to the literal service name `db` rather than sourced from .env.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L22-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:77fe4742624e4406a213cf5c3072db1a612e451034c065b914ded374e5bd7072:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L25-L25",
